# Theming (Prokat)

## Colors

- New UI: `context.colors` (`AppColorsTheme`) only
- Never use raw `AppColors.*` / `AppColorsDark.*` in widgets
- Never hardcode `Color(0xFF…)` in feature UI

## Typography

- Use `AppFonts.*(context)` — styles already include theme-aware text color
- `copyWith(color:)` only for exceptions (error, onPrimary on filled button, accent)
- Do not require VIP-style “colorless font + copyWith everywhere”

## Metrics

- Spacing / radius / button / input / sheet → `AppDimens`
- No magic numbers; add a named token if missing
- No feature-specific dimens in `app_dimens.dart`
